  (text "VGA INPUT + ANALOG FRONT END"
    (at 20 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid cfa50d56-dcb6-50c1-8076-0309e5c974e0)
  )
  (text "RGB: 75R termination, 100R + 47nF AC coupling into the"
    (at 20 112 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1cda2525-c9df-5944-9df9-2c7982c72e65)
  )
  (text "differential ADC inputs; negative inputs return to VGA ground."
    (at 20 115.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 51c485f8-f90b-56d8-a9c8-fd2b25dcff48)
  )
  (text "DDC pins 58/59 carry EDID (RTD2660 DDC RAM) and the Realtek"
    (at 20 119 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 813895ce-e7dc-5534-90bb-b6ed6162ba6a)
  )
  (text "ISP protocol: firmware can be flashed through the VGA cable."
    (at 20 122.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 5676e297-cc0e-5d02-8dd4-854b44e9ef13)
  )
  (text "CRYSTAL, RESET, STRAPS"
    (at 20 140 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d177a798-3bb4-5c7e-9a51-b33e7fd1d8c8)
  )
  (text "R26: SPI_CEB strap, low at reset = embedded MCU (datasheet pin 118 note)."
    (at 20 193 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b341294c-67f6-55df-87b4-df3a1290fb0d)
  )
  (text "R25: pin 2 reference resistor, 1k to VDD as on PCB800099-type boards."
    (at 20 196.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9e2bf7ed-e54f-5f53-9d1a-e350e4df1729)
  )
  (text "R24: CEC pull-up required by the datasheet even when CEC is unused."
    (at 20 200 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 87d47b99-aaaf-5bcf-abc5-2b8b7af57ab2)
  )
  (text "RTD2660 has an internal low-voltage reset; R23/C29 only add a short delay."
    (at 20 203.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 80a276f6-f5f5-502e-aa4f-1cd82bbdc3ea)
  )
  (text "RTD2660 DECOUPLING (place one 100nF at each supply pin)"
    (at 20 214 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d7e37817-81f2-5ad2-b7e8-19139bd538c2)
  )
  (text "TTL data follows the PCB800099 wiring so stock TTL firmware works: panel R0..R5 = pins 66..71, R6/R7 = 74/75,"
    (at 150 26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid bbd8d03a-c0f5-5114-8825-59cf2856eb44)
  )
  (text "G0..G7 = 76..83, B0..B7 = 86..93, DEN = 94, DHS = 95, DCLK = 96, DVS = 97 (firmware: _DISP_RB_SWAP | _DISP_ML_SWAP, 24-bit)."
    (at 150 29.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid bc6a137a-385b-57c7-9890-df134da35df2)
  )
  (text "Control pins as PCB800099: 110 = panel power (high = on), 111 = backlight (low = on), 102 = PWM0 dimming, 53 = ADC keys."
    (at 150 33 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid aa3432d9-9f4b-5568-991e-65ac5dc356da)
  )
  (text "SPI FLASH (firmware)"
    (at 290 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2b429e42-13e0-5da2-8b87-e6ec29e9fe8d)
  )
  (text "J4: in-circuit programming of U4 (hold RESETB, pin 7, low while programming)."
    (at 290 72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fbd5a520-8310-51c3-929c-9ab2d1273035)
  )
  (text "SETTINGS EEPROM (optional, 0xA0)"
    (at 290 84 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ea8f076b-2f34-5970-98eb-8208c1135618)
  )
  (text "KEYPAD (ADC ladder) / LED / IR HEADER"
    (at 290 128 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 61f0ee93-e569-5a57-aeb5-3d98b1bfa37e)
  )
  (text "J7: 1 +3V3  2 GND  3 POWER  4 MENU  5 UP  6 DOWN  7 SOURCE  8 LED1  9 LED2  10 IR"
    (at 290 208 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 35192d3d-850f-54ec-bcbd-4e4a435adcae)
  )
  (text "Keys are plain switches to GND: the PCB800099 ADC ladder (0R / 1k / 2k / 3.9k / 10k"
    (at 290 211.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ad1e8524-f824-577b-9150-6d408e329108)
  )
  (text "against the 4.7k pull-up R29) is on this board, read by RTD pin 53 (A-ADC3)."
    (at 290 215 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 57993e2b-e319-5179-882b-eae72e5b2fcd)
  )
  (text "LED1 = RTD pin 52, LED2 = pin 65: pin high = LED on (LED from header pin to GND)."
    (at 290 218.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c62570d4-91fd-5c35-b120-07f1f6e3eaf2)
  )
  (text "IR receiver output to pin 10 (RTD pin 64)."
    (at 290 222 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ebe80b38-8067-5d62-82ec-6caa3a9c5395)
  )
